 énergétique au miel","form":"solid","info":{"quantity":{"value":1,"metric":"item"},"cho":{"value":15,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":0,"metric":"mg"}}}]]}}},"stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.720930232558139,"expectedDuration":3000},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":3000,"pace":{"value":329}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_35","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Sur ce footing, pense en particulier à ton économie de course. Essaye de ressentir l'énergie \"perdue\" au moment de l'impact au sol et de minimiser cette énergie perdue avec une foulée plus légère.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_35","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":329,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":35,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":6,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.104651162790698,"expectedDuration":2100},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2100,"pace":{"value":329}}]}],"weekStats":{"expectedDistance":32.15894987347873,"realDistance":0,"expectedDuration":11100,"realDuration":0},"exportStatus":"NotAvailable","goalDuration":{"durationInWeeks":20,"index":3},"coach":{"name":"Tristan","image":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1765362553-tristan-tete.png"},"access":"allowed"},{"userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","_id":"6a6743f2ba63bbdf0c9c5ded","articles":["SDCSkSizQpqYMMaLDOV_rQ","DrR-I6_nStWjdMo17BlCHw","JQqpHs_NR_SmcUdR84cnjQ","Y2kRza6pRdOsRsIQxSYo7w","GssCR6PsTvu-36aGA22sVQ"],"weekDate":1786924800000,"context":{"priority":"performance","backgroundGoal":"speed","goalId":"6a6743eeba63bbdf0c9c5de1","cycleTheme":"S60","cycleDescription":"En fonction de ton profil et du temps jusqu'à l'objectif, ce cycle S60 sur mesure commence 3-4 mois avant ton semi-marathon. L'objectif est simple : catapulter ton niveau jusqu'à l'affutage. Un cycle qui repoussera tes limites avec des intervalles longs, mais qui te mettra vraiment en confiance. Tout ce que tu as réalisé avant ce cycle prendra son sens ici, c'est ici qu'on aligne toutes les planètes.","isStatic":false},"estimatedPaces":[{"slug":"slow","value":598.6976076896065,"dvalue":40,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"moderate","value":254.75731815112857,"dvalue":11.608566551956223,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"fast","value":192.05763027578735,"dvalue":5.69752462249924,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sprint","value":153.77088061779978,"dvalue":3.254880624932233,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"ef","value":327.9087093682076,"dvalue":20.10199868447083,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"tempo","value":299.8795797293558,"dvalue":16.687645453135573,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sweet-spot","value":268.20567442992245,"dvalue":13.062952909132688,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"aerobie","value":318.18824619423356,"dvalue":18.897494474129754,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil60","value":254.75731815112857,"dvalue":11.608566551956223,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil30","value":241.9832887186469,"dvalue":10.279530782104944,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vma","value":211.85268307189702,"dvalue":7.379435540905239,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"marathon","value":289.241654757931,"dvalue":14.25898327580912,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"half-marathon","