"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Un autre footing ? Oui mais sur celui-là écoute encore plus tes sensations que d'habitude ! Es-tu aussi facile que d'habitude ? Ou est-ce que la fatigue pointe le bout de son nez et rend la fin de footing plus difficile ? Si c'est le cas, fais attention à la suite de la semaine, tu es dans un état qui fait progresser mais qui peut aussi vite se retourner contre toi si tu vas trop loin dans cette fatigue !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.0588235294117645,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_7","description":"Séance de seuil 60' où tu vas enchaîner **4 répétitions de 7'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 3' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"Oui les intervalles sont longs, très longs même à cette allure, on ne va pas te mentir. Les séances à ce moment de ce cycle commencent à être vraiment difficiles. Mais c'est le moment de voir où tu en es, de réaliser la progression que tu as pu avoir ! Quoi qu'il arrive, donne ton maximum sur cette séance, c'est le principal.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_7","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil60"},"durations":[{"value":7,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":594,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a6743f6ba18ec4605217a87","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1791158400000,"sessionIndex":2,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[