ion":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_30","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"En semaine de récupération, on y va encore plus molo sur le footing pour être sûr de réduire la fatigue à zéro avant de reprendre des semaines plus intenses.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5.294117647058823,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_35_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Encore un footing accompagné de lignes droites ! J'espère que tu ressens l'effet positif que ces lignes droites ont sur ta mécanique ? Personnellement, je me sens vraiment \"bien dans ma foulée\" après avoir fait des lignes droites ! C'est comme si ça remettait tout en place !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_25","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":25,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":190,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":594,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.0458767238953,"expectedDuration":2100},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1500,"pace":{"value":325}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"p