0c9c5de1","cycleTheme":"affutage","cycleDescription":"On rentre dans le Money Time. Dernier mois de préparation. 3 semaines d'allure Semi, avec des intervalles courts et des longs, et une \"séance test\" en semaine 3. L'objectif : se préparer spécifiquement à l'effort de ton objectif. Ton plus gros volume hebdomadaire du bloc sera quant à lui atteint 2 semaines avant la course pour se laisser le temps d'effacer la fatigue PROGRESSIVEMENT jusqu'à la course (oui, on ne coupe pas tout du jour au lendemain. Tu vas avoir des séances intenses jusqu'à l'avant-dernière semaine).","isStatic":true},"estimatedPaces":[{"slug":"slow","value":588.4416599397551,"dvalue":40,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"moderate","value":250.3932156220855,"dvalue":11.409706809611539,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"fast","value":188.7676003913019,"dvalue":5.599923573018952,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sprint","value":151.13671923681358,"dvalue":3.1991231186510065,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"ef","value":322.29149201706514,"dvalue":19.757642793404035,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"tempo","value":294.74251343503687,"dvalue":16.401778902748198,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sweet-spot","value":263.61119576851274,"dvalue":12.839178902398574,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"aerobie","value":312.7375445617715,"dvalue":18.573772258706672,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil60","value":250.3932156220855,"dvalue":11.409706809611539,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil30","value":237.83801081280578,"dvalue":10.103437994627306,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vma","value":208.2235554115479,"dvalue":7.253022633355827,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"marathon","value":283.89330699708603,"dvalue":13.971813714670317,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"half-marathon","value":258.2107091381071,"dvalue":12.248717900858496,"abstract":false,"